  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-bffe03609f@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>For the third year in a row, we earned 100 percent on the Human Rights Campaign (HRC) Foundation’s Corporate Equality Index (CEI) for LGBTQ Workplace Equality!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The HRC gathers information from an annual CEI survey and assigns a rating. Criteria includes: Equal employment opportunity policies, employment benefits, organizational LGBT competency&nbsp;and public commitment.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To learn more about the Corporate Equality Index, check out&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.hrc.org/campaigns/corporate-equality-index\">Human Rights Campaign’s site</a>.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 29 2019 19:13:39 GMT+0000",
